# Build mode: a road three cells long (each joining the last); a house (R1 x5, L1: white walls, blue roof) facing
# him, a smithy (L1: wooden roof), a mill (R1 x2: red roof), corn (R1); the house removed; then
# the village refuses ("aqui não"). log prints his place and the changes kept.
tp 12 60
wait 10
key X
hold DOWN+RIGHT 2
wait 5
shot c00-target
key A
wait 4
shot c01-swing
wait 20
hold DOWN+RIGHT 12
key A
wait 25
hold DOWN+RIGHT 12
key A
wait 25
shot c02-road3
tool house
key R1
wait 2
key R1
wait 2
key R1
wait 2
key R1
wait 2
key R1
wait 2
key L1
wait 2
shot c03-house-variant
hold UP+RIGHT 2
key A
wait 25
shot c03-house
tool smithy
key L1
hold LEFT 2
key A
wait 25
tool mill
key R1
wait 2
key R1
hold DOWN+LEFT 2
key A
wait 25
shot c04-smith-mill
tool field
key R1
hold UP 2
key A
wait 25
shot c05-corn
tool remove
hold UP+RIGHT 2
key A
wait 25
shot c06-removed-house
log
tp 80 59
wait 10
key A
wait 10
shot c07-village-refused
